# The web server's run-time settings on the VM (C-145): /opt/amplychat/web.env, mode 600, never
# committed. Copy this file there and paste the values (docs/ops/deploy-vm.md).
#
# Only server-side secrets belong here. Every NEXT_PUBLIC_* value is inlined into the image when
# it is built (apps/web/Dockerfile), so it comes from the GitHub variables of the
# `production-build` environment, not from this file: setting one here changes nothing. That
# includes NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL (https://dashboard.amplychat.com, C-146), which splits the site and
# the app onto two hosts.
#
# Format: KEY=value on one line, no quotes, no comments after the value.

# [owner] Clerk → API keys → the production instance's secret key (the same instance as the
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY build variable and the API's CLERK_SECRET_KEY). Required even
# for the website-only deploy: the middleware runs Clerk on every page.
CLERK_SECRET_KEY=
